  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: Represents interpersonal roles associated with a patient, such as caregiver, emergency contact, guarantor, or next of kin. These roles may impact communication, consent, or care coordination.),(Data Element Scope: Supports structured documentation of an individual's role in relation to a patient for administrative, legal, or care coordination purposes.),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes select codes from http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-RoleClass),(Exclusion Criteria: Excludes codes other than the selected codes.)",
